msgid "AeroNav-1 Dual-Band GNSS (NavIC Supported)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroNav-1.rst:6
#: 7502fabbfce24c13a9f26fd04f167252
msgid "The **AeroNav-1** is an industrial-grade, dual-band GNSS module **designed and manufactured in India** by TeraVolt Labs. It is specifically engineered to support the **NavIC (IRNSS) constellation**, making it fully compliant with DGCA requirements for indigenous drone manufacturing. It features a high-sensitivity L1 + L5 receiver (**Ublox-F10N**) and an integrated **Bosch BMM350** 3-axis magnetometer for precise heading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroNav-1.rst:14
#: 35a84d1487c547fcacfa12abce781322
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroNav-1.rst:16
#: 3c1ca88070504c03b9f7f2ce454691aa
msgid "**NavIC Support:** Native support for Indian Regional Navigation Satellite System (IRNSS) on L5 band."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroNav-1.rst:17
#: d226d87debc64cf1b0d488a5fd592cd4
msgid "**Dual-Band Precision:** Simultaneously tracks L1 and L5 signals for superior multipath rejection in urban environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroNav-1.rst:18
#: f676cbc3256f472f9ef9329e154cc07b
